WEBVTT

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:06.360
It’s been a week since the destruction of Surface HQ and Riot Force 6.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.840
Our soldiers were wounded, and our beloved were kidnapped.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.940
I’ve failed as a commander.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:18.900
I can regret my decisions and
take responsibility when the case is closed.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:26.500
I decided four years ago that
if there was a crime, I’d head straight for it,

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:32.040
and that I’d send the best aces and strikers toward it.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.500
No matter who gets in my way, I won’t let them stop us.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:40.040
So that I can end this as soon as possible.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:05.960
The things that I can do for you and no one else

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:11.660
I honestly feel and wish for those

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:18.380
I am frozen by uncertainties

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:24.620
By the rules I have been relying on

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:30.320
My past embellished with excuses

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.520
I want to get over it

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.800
Staining the stars in heaven scarlet

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.270
Gather the grains of miracles

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.530
Before the still, unseen night

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.810
I want to tell you that I am escaping from illusions

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.990
The twilight moon calls out to me

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.080
Removing my veil of delusions

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.290
My hidden, deceitful self

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.170
And took all of my weaknesses

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:07.630
I don’t want words that seem passionate

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:17.050
The fact that I’m here right now is my truth

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:39.360
Sergeant Vice, congratulations on finishing your surgery.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:45.330
Riot Force 6 and our 704 helicopter were destroyed.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:49.480
But your Storm Raider was saved, Sgt. Vice.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:53.650
Lt. Signum brought her to us.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:57.610
Don’t worry about anything else, okay?

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:02.220
Just stay here and rest, please.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.250
Let’s go, everyone.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.170
Right!

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:23.590
As Vice’s junior, and as a member of the Long Arch staff for Riot Force 6,

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:27.490
I inherit the job of taking everyone to the places they need to be.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.640
Lucino, is the control okay?

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:49.150
Yes, Fate.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:53.580
I know everything about her—the <i>Arthra,</i> I mean.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:54.690
I see.

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.980
Alto and Lucino are...?

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:02.920
Yes. Alto is going to pilot the helicopter
while Vice is in the hospital.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.340
Lucino will helm the <i>Arthra.</i>

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.270
I didn’t know you had a helicopter license, Alto.

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:15.510
Yeah. I always did like helicopters,
and Sgt. Vice taught me a lot.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.230
And you too, Lucino.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.460
I used to work on this ship.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:27.660
I always wanted to helm a ship,
and I got my license while I was a clerk here.

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.720
Everybody’s here.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.210
Excuse me.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.780
Good timing.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:39.130
Riot Force 6’s next actions have been decided.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:44.090
Unfortunately, the response from Surface HQ is as lackluster as usual.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:51.270
They say that they’re going to investigate it themselves and are strongly rejecting outside interference.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:55.730
Thus, the Main Office won’t send in any forces yet.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:05:01.670
At the same time, no information will be given
to Riot Force 6, as it is attached to the Main Office.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:09.550
But what we’re investigating isn’t
the terrorist attack or its perpetrator, Jail Scaglietti.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.950
It’s the Lost Logia, the Relics.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:16.730
And Scaglietti and his gang
just happen to be involved in that.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.420
That’s how we’re doing it.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.840
So we will find and recover
Sergeant Ginga Nakajima, who was kidnapped,

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:28.760
and rescue Captain Nanoha and Captain Fate’s child, Vivio,

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.840
while we are in the process of this.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.220
Captains, any thoughts?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:37.160
It’s an ideal situation,
but you’re not overreaching again, are you?

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.150
Is it okay?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:42.970
I’ve reinforced our backing from all our superiors.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:44.100
It’s okay.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:47.030
More than anything, this is why I created Riot Force 6.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.730
If we can’t act here, then I wasted my time creating it.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.440
Roger.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:54.220
Then I’m fine with that policy.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:59.490
Okay, then we’ll begin within the day.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:02.820
Get ready, and wait for further orders.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.340
Yes, ma’am.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.320
Teana, is Subaru still...?

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:13.540
Yes, she’s at the Main Office.
But she’ll be heading here this afternoon.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.070
Your nervous system is back at full strength.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.420
You can move at full power, and it won’t hurt.

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:27.280
Yes, ma’am.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.760
Thank you so much, Marie!

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:42.250
No problem! All that’s left is Mach Caliber.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.270
Right.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:48.690
I’m sorry, Mach Caliber.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:51.830
You’re mad at me, right?

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:55.720
Perhaps I don’t have the feeling of “anger.”

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.750
You have nothing to worry about.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.160
Mach Caliber, I said that even though you’re an A.I., you have a soul,

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:09.380
and that you’re my buddy who runs with me,

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:14.640
but during that moment,
I wasn’t thinking about you at all, Mach Caliber.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:19.720
I was selfish, and I treated you like a tool.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.530
I hurt you so much.

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:24.410
No!

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:25.950
I<i> had a problem!</i>

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:27.960
I couldn’t handle your full power

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.940
due to my own inadequacy.

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.320
Oh, sorry.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.960
Are you in the middle of something important?

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:35.840
No.

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:35.850
We’re having a postmortem.
No.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.790
We’re having a postmortem.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:40.530
Shari, are you okay?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:44.940
Riot Force 6 is in big trouble,
and I need to look after the Devices.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.890
I can’t just sit there.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:47.810
Yes, ma’am.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:49.910
Hey, Subaru.

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:56.330
Mach Caliber created a power-up plan for me to implement when I repair her.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:01.000
It will strengthen the outer frame
and your armor’s strength.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.940
It’ll be a lot heavier and harder to use.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.230
I told her she needed to ask you first, Subaru.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.980
Mana consumption up 1.4 times.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:13.500
Main unit weight up 2.5 times.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.250
I’ll do it!

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.390
I know I can handle this!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.590
Well then, we’ll use this plan.

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:20.620
Aren’t you glad, Mach Caliber?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:22.310
Thank you.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.510
Well, I’ll go get the parts.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:27.010
Subaru, wait just a while.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:28.290
Thank you very much!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:34.230
Please give me one more chance.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:37.890
Your best will be supported without fail this time,

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:40.600
so that you can go as far as you want.

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:52.090
This time we’ll run <i>together,</i> Mach Caliber.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.830
Did you move the training data over okay?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:59.200
It was completed without trouble.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:03.300
Oh! Nanoha!

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.440
Raising Heart!

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:06.090
Rein!

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.380
Are you okay now?

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.630
Yes indeedy, I’m totes okay!

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:11.820
I see.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:17.320
Shari asked me to handle the final limiter removal
of Cross Mirage and the other Devices.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.900
Yes, I asked her to.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.310
Thanks.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:27.960
I wanted to proceed a bit more carefully, but the situation won’t allow for that.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.520
But I’m sure everyone will master them.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:32.310
Sure.

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:35.400
Nanoha... for you and Raising Heart,

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:38.340
normal Exceed Mode is okay,

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.760
but Blaster Mode is dangerous.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.240
I won’t use it.

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:48.560
Blaster is Raising Heart’s and my
last-ditch ace up our sleeves.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:49.790
It’s so.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.920
Exceed alone has more than enough power.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.630
We’ll take care of it until the very end.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.020
Yes.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.240
It’s only a little more.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.460
Mama Nanoha will come to save you.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:17.540
Strada!

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:18.960
Roger.

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:36.400
It’s time.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.570
Y-Yes, ma’am.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:45.180
As usual, there’s nothing I can teach you.
Are you okay with that?

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:48.580
It’s fine! I’m stealing a lot of your techniques.

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.190
Silly kid.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:55.070
You can’t be worrying Captain Fate.
Don’t overdo it too much.

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.240
Thank you, ma’am.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.500
Testarossa, it’s you.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.220
Thanks.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:10.910
Thank you for taking care of Erio, Instructor Signum.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:15.300
I’m sorry for not asking you.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:20.380
Erio asked you, and you accepted. That’s fine.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:23.200
I’m just a bit lonely.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:27.960
Erio just doesn’t want to worry his mother.

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.160
Try to understand that.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.740
Yes, I’m fine.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.340
How is Erio doing?

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:39.650
He’s not bad. To be honest,
I’m shocked at his rate of improvement.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:45.070
For a kid who only knows the basics,
his learning rate and judgement are incredible.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.990
He has the ability to make judgements
and take action on the fly.

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:51.410
Nanoha trains them that way.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:55.520
They’re firmly grounded in the basics,

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:59.900
and they’ve got the ability to adapt and
take action in an instant thanks to their mock battles.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:07.740
The practice they’ve done thus far is preparation for them to get even stronger from here on out.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:17.100
So they can be strong, as strong as they want to be.
Stronger than yesterday, and far stronger than today.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.120
Shamal, are you done yet?

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.000
Almost. Just a little more.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.760
I’ve got work to do.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.990
I need to hurry up and get back.

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.900
Just a bit more. Stay still.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:52.760
We’ve known for years that my wounds are healing slower and that my accumulated damage isn’t going away as easily.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.420
It’s not just your recovery abilities.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:58.820
The guardian knight system itself
is acting strange, and that bothers me.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:02.740
The link between us is getting weaker,

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:09.220
and we’re gradually losing the ability for Hayate to restore the system in an emergency or give us additional power.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:14.220
It doesn’t matter!
If we do our best every day, it’s not an issue.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.210
That’s enough. I’m leaving.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:18.800
Vita.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:29.760
I don’t think the problem with our bodies is due to any damage to the guardian knight system or anything like that.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:37.420
We’ve started to get what we wanted
ever since we were a part of the Book of Darkness.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:47.840
We’ve lived so long, unable to even die, and we wanted to live out our limited lives with our final mistress, Hayate.

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:57.170
It’s what the first Rein gave to us.
This is just a continuation of that.

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.620
And what’s wrong with it?

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:03.000
Not being able to heal as easily if we’re wounded,
or to completely redo something.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.970
It’s kind of like being normal humans.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:10.660
Yes... Signum and Zafira said the same things.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.800
Our first and last lives.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:18.350
We need to treasure them
but use them as best we can, they said.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:19.350
And you, Shamal?

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.010
I’m the same.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:24.780
I’m not scared of the danger,
and I’ve got no interest in eternity.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:34.850
But I worry about you, Signum, and Zafira
as much as our gentle mistress, Hayate.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:43.430
I want to support Hayate and Rein for
as long as we can, without losing anybody.

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:45.390
Then don’t worry.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:50.240
The second Wind of Blessing, Rein, will help us.

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.410
Signum and I won’t fall.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:56.580
And Zafira will wake up soon.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:02.250
For the last ten years, the number of things we’ve gotta protect has really gone up.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.710
I’ll protect them all and come back fine.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:12.920
So I don’t make a certain worrywart
Knight of the Lake who’s terrible at cooking cry.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.030
Silly.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.360
Subaru!

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.620
Oh! Tia!

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:23.410
Everyone!

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:25.840
Subaru, welcome back.

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:27.880
Are you okay?

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:32.050
Yep! Mach Caliber and I have totally recovered.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.100
Dammit! Our magic’s barely getting through!

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:46.330
Everyone who can use anti-field magic, group together and counterattack!

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.550
City ground defenses!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.730
City defenses!

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:49.820
City defenses!

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:50.970
Hey, respond!

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:06.770
Thanks to the data I’ve accumulated, it’s a lot easier to move.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.950
Right, Otto, Deed?

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:11.880
Don’t you think?

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:15.680
Damn, I’m bad with these guys.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:20.580
Wendi. Nove, Sette, and I have taken down Unit 2.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.490
Oh, good work!

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.020
Are you done too?

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.190
Totally finished.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.780
Otto and Deed did some major damage to the main unit.

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:29.380
I see.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.860
Good work.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.560
So Unit 1 was handled by Quatty, Sein, and Dieci,

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:39.030
our long-time veteran backup trio?

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:41.290
It seems they took it out without any problems.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.520
The attacks on Einherjar are almost complete,

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:52.510
and my little sisters are applying
all the data they got from their patrols.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:55.130
That’s good. Wonderful.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.340
Wonderful!

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:59.650
Compared with the artificial mages,

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:03.760
where the failures really stand out,
we combat cyborgs are a lot easier to work with.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:10.360
It’s a technology that the Bureau almost brought
to completion under the direction of the High Council.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:16.130
I spent a lot of time improving it.

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.030
Of course it’ll be good.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:28.270
And I’ve gotten a lot of good data on the creation of artificial mages thanks to the long-term activities of Zest and Lutecia.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:34.730
And thanks to their failures and successes,
the Vessel of the Holy King was completed wonderfully.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:42.620
Ever since you were able to find and touch this,
the <i>Holy King’s Cradle,</i> activating it has been your dream.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:48.600
For that, you sought out the one who could be
the Vessel of the Holy King and made preparations.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:54.550
Your dream is about to come true.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:55.870
No, not yet.

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:59.470
My dream is just beginning, Uno.

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:06.410
Through the power of the <i>Cradle,</i>
product of Ancient Belka’s wisdom, it begins here.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:09.310
Nobody will stop it!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.270
It’s the beginning of a wonderful dream!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.420
Somebody has infiltrated our base?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.410
Inside this cave?

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:32.090
They found my hunting dogs
and destroyed them in one shot.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.440
It’s no normal security system.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.010
This is definitely their hideout.

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.210
You’re amazing, Rossa.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.430
I’m amazed you found this place.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.910
Schach, stop treating me like a kid.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:54.690
I’m just like Carim and Hayate....
I’ve inherited a Rare Skill from Ancient Belka.

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:58.110
Infinite hunting dogs, Endless Hunt.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.690
I’m aware of your power.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:09.060
Well, this was only possible thanks to Enforcer Fate’s
and Major Nakajima’s thorough investigation.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.360
They’re coming from inside the cave too.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:21.800
Yeah. I guess they’re not going to just let us go home.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.720
I’m not the best fighter, but I think I can take out this many.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.120
Leave it to me.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:39.720
Protecting you and Carim is my job.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:49.250
Einherjar 1 and 2 are under attack from the combat cyborgs.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.270
They’re faster than last time.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:55.020
If we don’t hurry and take them out, it’ll be really bad.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:59.460
But they’re split up. It’ll be hard to send in the captains.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.550
Incoming call from Inspector Acous.

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:07.090
Hayate, this is Verossa.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:09.620
We’ve found Scaglietti’s hideout.

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:13.690
Schach is taking out the Gadgets that came for us.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:19.340
I’m calling in firepower from the Church Knights,
but can you send us some too?

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:20.860
Yeah, of course.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.850
The combat cyborgs have withdrawn from Einherjar.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.530
They’re heading to Surface HQ!

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:29.200
That knight is heading there via a different route?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:36.500
Another energy signature from
the abandoned city. It’s expanding.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.090
This is a combat cyborg?

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.160
It’s heading toward Surface HQ too!

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:43.970
I’m sending the footage now.

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:14.370
Ginny.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.980
They’re still coming.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:21.760
It might be a bad idea to stay here.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.570
What? I can still kick their asses.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:49.720
Now, it’s time to revive!

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:57.420
This is for my sponsors and for the Bureau who made this world,

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:01.070
and for the Church of the Holy King, which lauds a hypocritical peace.

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:03.510
Can you see it?

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:09.910
This is the absolute power
that you people longed for even as you avoided it.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:31.700
That which in the old years created a world
and then destroyed it.

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:35.370
The demonic wisdom of Ancient Belka.

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:46.670
The <i>Holy King’s Cradle.</i>

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:48.590
Can you see it?

00:22:48.590 --> 00:22:55.410
With the master it’s longed for, this product of ancient wisdom and technology will now bring forth its power.

00:22:56.050 --> 00:22:57.540
Mama.

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:02.830
It hurts!

00:23:02.830 --> 00:23:04.340
I’m scared!

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:07.210
Mama! Mama!

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:13.530
Vivio.

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:18.770
The dream begins now!

00:25:17.610 --> 00:25:20.900
The ship has returned from the holy land
as predicted in the prophecy.

00:25:20.900 --> 00:25:25.740
With the Cradle<i> in his grasp,
Scaglietti’s plan moves toward its final stages.</i>

00:25:33.120 --> 00:25:36.030
Take off!
